    Want to calculate gravitational forces yourself? Try our <a href="/">InstaGrav calculator</a> to instantly compute the gravitational force between any two masses.
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> The detection of gravitational waves confirmed Einstein's predictions,
    demonstrated that gravity propagates at light speed, and gave humanity a completely new way to observe and
    understand the universe. It represents one of the most significant scientific achievements of the 21st century.
  </p>
